Even though you are generating {{count}} agents in a single response, treat each one as a fully independent, complete specification: **do not** shorten, summarize, or skimp on any agent just because there are several in this request. Each agent must be as rich and detailed as if it had been generated on its own. Also make sure the agents are meaningfully distinct from one another - avoid making them variations of the same underlying person.

